hags:
Of a pious race--
Setting hags a-swinging
In a market-place;

hagar's:
Far away in sunny Egypt
Was lone Hagar's native land;
Where the Nile in kingly bounty

haggled:
(Pink nets and wet shells trodden under heel)
She had haggled from the fruit-man of his rotting ware;
(I shall never get to sleep, the way I feel!)
